<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="560139"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1536116985"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="六等星の夜"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Aimer"/><amll:meta key="album" value="六等星の夜 / 悲しみはオーロラに / TWINKLE TWINKLE LITTLE STAR"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:38.173"><div begin="00:14.418" end="05:14.329"><p begin="00:14.418" end="00:18.352" itunes:key="L1527">傷ついたときは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">受伤的时候</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu tsu i ta to ki wa</span></p><p begin="00:18.362" end="00:25.814" itunes:key="L1528">そっと包みこんでくれたらうれしい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要你将我温柔环抱我就无比感激</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so 't to tsu tsu mi ko n de ku re ta ra u re shi i</span></p><p begin="00:27.583" end="00:32.675" itunes:key="L1529">転んで立てないときは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一蹶不振时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ro n de ta te na i to ki wa</span></p><p begin="00:32.685" end="00:38.845" itunes:key="L1530">少しの勇気をください<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请给我一点点的勇气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ko shi no yu u ki wo ku da sa i</span></p><p begin="00:39.792" end="00:45.973" itunes:key="L1531">想いはずっと届かないまま 今日も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你却始终不知道我的心意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo i wa zu 't to to do ka na i ma ma</span></p><p begin="00:45.983" end="00:49.253" itunes:key="L1532">冷たい街でひとり<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo u mo tsu me ta i ma chi de hi to ri</span></p><p begin="00:49.263" end="00:55.915" itunes:key="L1533">ココが何処かも思い出せない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想不起自己身在哪里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ga do ko ka mo o mo i da se na i</span></p><p begin="00:55.925" end="01:02.558" itunes:key="L1534">終わらない夜に願いはひとつ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无尽长夜里 愿望只有一个而已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o wa ra na i yo ru ni ne ga i wa hi to tsu</span></p><p begin="01:02.568" end="01:09.244" itunes:key="L1535">"星のない空に輝く光を"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望星光点亮这幽暗的夜空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ ho shi no na i so ra ni ka ga ya ku hi ka ri wo ”</span></p><p begin="01:09.254" end="01:16.266" itunes:key="L1536">戻れない場所に捨てたものでさえ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那回不去的地方和被舍弃的过往</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo do re na i ba sho ni su te ta mo no de sa e</span></p><p begin="01:16.276" end="01:22.689" itunes:key="L1537">生まれ変わって明日をきっと照らす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也重获新生明天一定能沐浴光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma re ka wa 't te a shi ta wo ki 't to te ra su</span></p><p begin="01:22.699" end="01:29.250" itunes:key="L1538">星屑のなかであなたに出会えた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在繁星中与你相遇</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho shi ku zu no na ka de a na ta ni de a e ta</span></p><p begin="01:29.260" end="01:35.880" itunes:key="L1539">いつかの気持ちのまま会えたらよかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望相见的时候还是曾经的心情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka no ki mo chi no ma ma a e ta ra yo ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:35.890" end="01:42.978" itunes:key="L1540">戻らない過去に泣いたことでさえ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回不去的过往那些流泪的时光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo do ra na i ka ko ni na i ta ko to de sa e</span></p><p begin="01:42.988" end="01:48.464" itunes:key="L1541">生まれ変わって明日をきっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也重获新生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma re ka wa 't te</span></p><p begin="01:48.474" end="01:53.860" itunes:key="L1542">照らしてくれる</p><p begin="02:10.933" end="02:15.074" itunes:key="L1543">眠れないときは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难眠的夜里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne mu re na i to ki wa</span></p><p begin="02:15.084" end="02:22.265" itunes:key="L1544">そっと手をつないでくれたらうれしい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要你握住我的手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so 't to te wo tsu na i de ku re ta ra</span></p><p begin="02:24.233" end="02:28.399" itunes:key="L1545">夜明けは来るよと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请轻轻告诉我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo a ke wa ku ru yo to</span></p><p begin="02:28.409" end="02:31.720" itunes:key="L1546">囁いていて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快要拂晓就算是谎言也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa sa ya i te i te u so de mo i i ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:31.730" end="02:35.605" itunes:key="L1572">嘘でもいいから</p><p begin="02:36.354" end="02:42.575" itunes:key="L1547">願いはずっと叶わないまま 今夜<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿望始终实现不了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne ga i wa zu 't to ka na wa na i ma ma</span></p><p begin="02:42.585" end="02:45.849" itunes:key="L1548">星座を連れ去って<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n ya se i za wo tsu re sa 't te</span></p><p begin="02:45.859" end="02:52.665" itunes:key="L1549">消えてしまったもう、戻れない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从此完全消失再不归来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki e te shi ma 't ta mo u mo do re na i</span></p><p begin="02:52.675" end="02:59.241" itunes:key="L1550">終わらない夜に願いはひとつ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无尽长夜里 愿望只有一个而已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o wa ra na i yo ru ni ne ga i wa hi to tsu</span></p><p begin="02:59.251" end="03:05.927" itunes:key="L1551">"星のない空に輝く光を"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望星光点亮这幽暗的夜空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ ho shi no na i so ra ni ka ga ya ku hi ka ri wo ”</span></p><p begin="03:05.937" end="03:13.002" itunes:key="L1552">今は遠すぎて儚い星でも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使那星光遥远 虚幻无比</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma wa to o su gi te ha ka na i ho shi de mo</span></p><p begin="03:13.012" end="03:19.220" itunes:key="L1553">生まれ変わって夜空をきっと照らす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">斗转星移 也一定能让夜空沐浴光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma re ka wa 't te yo zo ra wo ki 't to te ra su</span></p><p begin="03:19.230" end="03:25.839" itunes:key="L1554">星屑のなかで出会えた奇跡が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在繁星中与你相遇的奇迹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho shi ku zu no na ka de de a e ta ki se ki ga</span></p><p begin="03:25.849" end="03:29.195" itunes:key="L1555">人ゴミのなかに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又落回了人群不见了踪影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to go mi no na ka ni ma ta mi e na ku na ru</span></p><p begin="03:29.205" end="03:32.578" itunes:key="L1573">また見えなくなる</p><p begin="03:32.588" end="03:39.650" itunes:key="L1556">戻らない過去に泣いた夜たちに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向回不去的过往和那些流泪的夜晚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo do ra na i ka ko ni na i ta yo ru ta chi ni</span></p><p begin="03:39.660" end="03:41.733" itunes:key="L1557">告げるサヨナラ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宣告离别</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ge ru sa yo na ra</span></p><p begin="03:41.743" end="03:50.302" itunes:key="L1574">明日はきっと輝けるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿明天一定要沐浴在光芒里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi ta wa ki 't to ka ga ya ke ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:51.166" end="03:56.221" itunes:key="L1559">こんなちいさな星座なのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只不过是个渺小的星座</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na chi i sa na se i za na no ni</span></p><p begin="03:56.231" end="03:59.268" itunes:key="L1560">ココにいたこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真的谢谢你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ni i ta ko to ki zu i te ku re te</span></p><p begin="03:59.278" end="04:02.564" itunes:key="L1561">気付いてくれて</p><p begin="04:02.574" end="04:06.775" itunes:key="L1562">ありがとう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能够注意到这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ri ga to u</span></p><p begin="04:15.976" end="04:22.650" itunes:key="L1563">終わらない夜に願いはひとつ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无尽长夜里 愿望只有一个而已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o wa ra na i yo ru ni ne ga i wa hi to tsu</span></p><p begin="04:22.660" end="04:29.226" itunes:key="L1564">"星のない空に輝く光を"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望星光点亮这幽暗的夜空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ ho shi no na i so ra ni ka ga ya ku hi ka ri wo ”</span></p><p begin="04:29.236" end="04:36.282" itunes:key="L1565">戻れない場所に捨てたものでさえ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那回不去的地方和被舍弃的过往</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo do re na i ba sho ni su te ta mo no de sa e</span></p><p begin="04:36.292" end="04:42.585" itunes:key="L1566">生まれ変わって明日をきっと照らす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也重获新生明天一定能沐浴光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma re ka wa 't te a shi ta wo ki 't to te ra su</span></p><p begin="04:42.595" end="04:49.272" itunes:key="L1567">星屑のなかであなたに出会えた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在繁星中与你相遇</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho shi ku zu no na ka de a na ta ni de a e ta</span></p><p begin="04:49.282" end="04:55.885" itunes:key="L1568">いつかの気持ちのまま会えたらよかった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望相见的时候还是曾经的心情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka no ki mo chi no ma ma a e ta ra yo ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="04:55.895" end="05:02.922" itunes:key="L1569">戻らない過去に泣いたことでさえ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回不去的过往那些流泪的时光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo do ra na i ka ko ni na i ta ko to de sa e</span></p><p begin="05:02.932" end="05:08.371" itunes:key="L1570">生まれ変わって明日をきっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也重获新生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma re ka wa 't te</span></p><p begin="05:08.381" end="05:14.329" itunes:key="L1571">照らしてくれる</p></div></body></tt>